OL,3,ALiving with a stink? Technology might
OL,4,Ahelp
OL,5,
OL,6,FMilpitas, an affluent city in
OL,7,FCalifornia's Silicon Valley tech hub,
OL,8,Fhas an odour problem.
OL,10,FFor decades, residents have had to
OL,11,Fendure rank smells wafting from
OL,12,Findustrial sites, among them a 342-acre
OL,13,Flandfill.
OL,15,F"When I first moved here, I could not
OL,16,Fopen my window for over 10 years," says
OL,17,FChia-Ling Kong, an engineer for a tech
OL,18,Ffirm who lives around half a mile from
OL,19,Fthe dump.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
